    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000960/extras/9e855cf7cffdb2130d72102a5b5eeb53.avif?t=1749696974\" width=600 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampdoll: The Blood-Drinking Maidens</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...They are girls who can only survive by drinking the blood of other girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To exterminate the monstrous beings known as &quot;Werewolves&quot;,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >they fight as part of the Imperial Army's Special Assault Unit, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >code-named &quot;Dog Killers: the Stray Dog Carnag&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As their &quot;rations&quot;, they are provided with girls known as &quot;Bride Thorns&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is a &quot;yuri&quot; girls' love story, where you witness the emotions between girls who have become vampires and their human partners.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What endings will they each choose...?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The era is Meiji.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sana Shirafuji, who lost her grandmother and is left alone in the world,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >knocks on the military's door to become a &quot;Bride Thorn&quot; to make a living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A &quot;Bride Thorn&quot; is a &quot;ration&quot; for girls known as &quot;Vampdolls&quot;,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >who are specialized in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unaware of this, Sana accepts the military contract out of desperation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On her first day of enlistment, she meets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yukine Hanafusa, a beautiful yet disdainful Vampdoll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradually, Sana and Yukine begin to understand each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the first night of blood drinking,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >they discover that the act of drinking blood brings physical and emotional exhilaration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite their awkwardness, they experience their first blood drinking together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some time later, Yukine becomes incapacitated during a certain operation...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sana Shirafuji</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000960/extras/4182b16cbfcbe6e5151ada98e8f6212b.avif?t=1749696974\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yukine Hanafusa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000960/extras/3109880acc2e5e18dd5f61dc33df0e4d.avif?t=1749696974\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ao Shinokura</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000960/extras/def26ca9d7b8f3bc990b51e5cf6bccb9.avif?t=1749696974\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ibuki Ninomiya</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000960/extras/4a16c6966a98d119640ba076149d12c9.avif?t=1749696974\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mio Tsumugi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000960/extras/2f2c70982e83b17cc021881535007eb2.avif?t=1749696974\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shiina Samura</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000960/extras/3dc68a4299c15eea8ed573a37f8e2702.avif?t=1749696974\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Highlights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse graphics by manga artist Saku Takano.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story that captures the delicate emotions of the girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pure love girls' love story with the concept of &quot;Vampires x Military Uniforms x Yuri&quot;.</p>",
